   "summary": "This document presents summary statistical tables (Tables 8 through 12 and Table 5) on educational institutions in Kochi Prefecture with data as of April 30 and November 30, 1946. It reports student enrollments and full-time and part-time teaching staff across prefectural, municipal, town and village, private, and other ministerial jurisdictions for higher, secondary, elementary, and special education.",
