   "summary": "Beginning with an unnumbered title page, this roster catalogs educational institutions in Kochi Prefecture with comparative data from April and November 1946. It details schools under the Ministry of Education, prefectural government, municipal offices, and town/village jurisdictions, including youth schools and 275 co-educational elementary schools. Each entry provides the school's official name, address, date founded, gender-disaggregated student enrollment, and full-time and part-time teacher numbers.",
